    "%@ in sets": {},
    "Holds the screen awake while NOOP pulls stored history from your strap, so you can watch a long sync finish without the phone locking. Only applies while a sync is running and NOOP is open. The screen sleeps normally the rest of the time. It uses a bit more battery while the screen stays on.": {},
    "How NOOP behaves while it pulls stored history from your strap.": {},
    "Keep screen on while syncing": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "شاشەکە ڕووناک بهێڵەرەوە لە کاتی هاوکاتکردندا"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "شاشەکە ڕووناک بهێڵەرەوە لە کاتی هاوکاتکردندا"}}}},
    "Last 7 days · estimated": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دوایین ٧ ڕۆژ · خەمڵێنراو"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دوایین ٧ ڕۆژ · خەمڵێنراو"}}}},
