    "Keep as it was": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "وەک خۆی بیهێڵەرەوە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "وەک خۆی بیهێڵەرەوە"}}}},
    "Choose an option above to save.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بۆ پاشەکەوتکردن یەکێک لە هەڵبژاردەکان هەڵبژێرە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بۆ پاشەکەوتکردن یەکێک لە هەڵبژاردەکان هەڵبژێرە."}}}},
    "Edit sets": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دەستکاریکردنی خولەکان"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دەستکاریکردنی خولەکان"}}}},
    "Save changes": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پاشەکەوتکردنی گۆڕانکارییەکان"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پاشەکەوتکردنی گۆڕانکارییەکان"}}}},
    "Completing saves them with the grey numbers shown. Discarding keeps them out of every figure; they stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in later.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Completing saves them with the grey numbers shown. Discarding keeps them out of every figure; they stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in later."}}}},
    "Fix numbers, or add and remove sets. Sets left at 0 reps stay out of the figures, and only this session changes — not the program.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Fix numbers, or add and remove sets. Sets left at 0 reps stay out of the figures, and only this session changes — not the program."}}}},
    "No sets were performed. Discarded sets stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No sets were performed. Discarded sets stay under Edit sets as zeros you can fill in."}}}},
    "Max RPE (1–10)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "زۆرترین RPE (١–١٠)"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "زۆرترین RPE (١–١٠)"}}}},
    "Max RPE must be between 1 and 10.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "زۆرترین RPE دەبێت لە نێوان ١ و ١٠ بێت."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "زۆرترین RPE دەبێت لە نێوان ١ و ١٠ بێت."}}}},
    "Max RPE is a ceiling: the hardest a set should feel, where 10 means nothing left. It shows grey during the session, and a set you leave unrated saves it as its rating.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Max RPE is a ceiling: the hardest a set should feel, where 10 means nothing left. It shows grey during the session, and a set you leave unrated saves it as its rating."}}}},
    "max RPE %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "max RPE %@"}}}},
    "Add a set to %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Add a set to %@"}}}},
    "Remove the last set from %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Remove the last set from %@"}}}},
    "The tick marks about 4 sets a week — the point below which the research doesn't reliably detect growth. Above it, gains continue with strongly diminishing returns and no clear ceiling, so the bar has no \"full\".": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The tick marks about 4 sets a week — the point below which the research doesn't reliably detect growth. Above it, gains continue with strongly diminishing returns and no clear ceiling, so the bar has no \"full\"."}}}},
    "%@: %@ sets, at or above the weekly floor of %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@: %2$@ sets, at or above the weekly floor of %3$@"}}}},
    "%@: %@ sets, below the weekly floor of %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%1$@: %2$@ sets, below the weekly floor of %3$@"}}}},
    "Discard session": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "فڕێدانی دانیشتن"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "فڕێدانی دانیشتن"}}}},
    "Discard this session?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەم دانیشتنە فڕێ بدرێت؟"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەم دانیشتنە فڕێ بدرێت؟"}}}},
    "Keep going": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بەردەوامبە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بەردەوامبە"}}}},
    "%lld recorded sets will be thrown away. Nothing is saved and no workout is created.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld recorded sets will be thrown away. Nothing is saved and no workout is created."}}}},
    "%lld recorded sets will be removed, and so will the workout this session created. This cannot be undone.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld recorded sets will be removed, and so will the workout this session created. This cannot be undone."}}}},
    "That file is too big to be a program sheet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "That file is too big to be a program sheet."}}}},
    "Worth checking": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "شایەنی پشکنینە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "شایەنی پشکنینە"}}}},
    "%lld exercises": {"localizations": {"en": {"variations": {"plural": {"one": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld exercise"}}, "other": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "%lld exercises"}}}}}}},
    "Import a program": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوردەکردنی پڕۆگرام"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوردەکردنی پڕۆگرام"}}}},
    "Fill it in on a computer": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر کۆمپیوتەر پڕی بکەرەوە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر کۆمپیوتەر پڕی بکەرەوە"}}}},
    "Download the template from the NOOP repository, fill in one row per exercise, then bring the file here. Excel, Numbers, Google Sheets and LibreOffice all work — .xlsx or .csv.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Download the template from the NOOP repository, fill in one row per exercise, then bring the file here. Excel, Numbers, Google Sheets and LibreOffice all work — .xlsx or .csv."}}}},
    "Only the exercise name is required. Anything you leave blank can be filled in later, or during the session.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Only the exercise name is required. Anything you leave blank can be filled in later, or during the session."}}}},
    "Choose a file": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "فایلێک هەڵبژێرە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "فایلێک هەڵبژێرە"}}}},
    "Choose a different file": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "فایلێکی تر هەڵبژێرە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "فایلێکی تر هەڵبژێرە"}}}},
    "These lines still import — anything unclassified can be set in the app.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "These lines still import — anything unclassified can be set in the app."}}}},
    "That file could not be read.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەو فایلە نەخوێندرایەوە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەو فایلە نەخوێندرایەوە."}}}},
    "That does not look like a spreadsheet. Use the template, saved as .xlsx or .csv.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "That does not look like a spreadsheet. Use the template, saved as .xlsx or .csv."}}}},
    "That sheet has no Exercise column. Use the template — the import matches on the header names.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "That sheet has no Exercise column. Use the template — the import matches on the header names."}}}},
    "That sheet has no exercises in it yet.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەو خشتەیە هێشتا هیچ جووڵەیەکی تێدا نییە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەو خشتەیە هێشتا هیچ جووڵەیەکی تێدا نییە."}}}},
    "Set %lld": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Set %lld"}}}},
