    "90D": {},
    "90d": {},
    "A %@ tonight tends to line up with about %@ higher on tomorrow’s %@ for you, based on %lld of your %@ days.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ higher on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on %4$lld of your %5$@ days."}}}},
    "A %@ tonight tends to line up with about %@ higher on tomorrow’s %@ for you, based on typical patterns.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ higher on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on typical patterns."}}}},
    "A %@ tonight tends to line up with about %@ lower on tomorrow’s %@ for you, based on %lld of your %@ days.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ lower on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on %4$lld of your %5$@ days."}}}},
    "A %@ tonight tends to line up with about %@ lower on tomorrow’s %@ for you, based on typical patterns.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "A %1$@ tonight tends to line up with about %2$@ lower on tomorrow’s %3$@ for you, based on typical patterns."}}}},
    "A 60-second snapshot of your beat-to-beat (R-R) intervals from the strap, cleaned (range and ectopic-beat filtering) before computing RMSSD the same way your overnight HRV is computed.": {},
    "A Shortcut wants to add %lld days and %lld workouts to the Apple Health import source.": {},
    "A Shortcut wants to add data to the Apple Health import source.": {},
    "A WHOOP export backfills recovery, strain, sleep and workouts. Apple Health can add HR, HRV, sleep, SpO₂, steps, workouts and weight.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوردەکردنی WHOOP چاکبوونەوە، فشار، خەو و ڕاهێنانە پێشووەکان پڕ دەکاتەوە. Apple Health دەتوانێت لێدانی دڵ، گۆڕانی لێدانی دڵ، خەو، ئۆکسجینی خوێن، هەنگاو، ڕاهێنان و کێش زیاد بکات."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوردەکردنی WHOOP چاکبوونەوە، فشار، خەو و ڕاهێنانە پێشووەکان پڕ دەکاتەوە. Apple Health دەتوانێت لێدانی دڵ، گۆڕانی لێدانی دڵ، خەو، ئۆکسجینی خوێن، هەنگاو، ڕاهێنان و کێش زیاد بکات."}}}},
    "A WHOOP membership runs $300–480 a year, for life. NOOP does this for free: one person, no servers, no subscription.": {},
    "A badge shows whether a number was scored on-device by NOOP, or imported from Whoop or Apple Health.": {},
    "A baseline-normalized recovery score: your resting heart rate, sleep quality and night-to-night consistency, weighted against your own baseline, with heart-rate variability (rMSSD) leading wherever the strap gives us a clean reading.": {},
    "A blend of how long you slept versus your personal need (the biggest factor), how efficiently (asleep versus in bed), how much was restorative (deep + REM sleep), and how consistent your sleep and wake timing is.": {},
    "A bulk markers CSV import (date, marker, value, unit) lands with the file importers in Data Sources, same as nutrition and lifting. For now, add readings one at a time above. Everything you import stays on %@.": {},
    "A buzz, not a banner": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەرزینێک، نەک ئاگادارکردنەوەیەکی سەر شاشە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەرزینێک، نەک ئاگادارکردنەوەیەکی سەر شاشە"}}}},
    "A calm evening reminder, timed from your wake time and usual sleep need. It's a suggestion, not an alarm.": {},
    "A calm hour now helps you hit your wake time well-rested.": {},
    "A cardiovascular load in the Banister TRIMP family: time spent in each heart-rate zone, weighted so harder zones count for more, summed into one daily figure.": {},
    "A classic one-glance read of NOOP's own scores. Same data, different lens.": {},
    "A clean, shareable one-page PDF of your recovery, sleep, HRV, resting heart rate and strain over a date range. Saved on your %@. Nothing leaves the device.": {},
    "A couple of metrics depend on which Apple Watch you wear. Wrist temperature, which feeds skin temp, arrived with Series 8, so older watches don't report it. Blood oxygen is the bigger one: Apple removed the SpO₂ sensor from the newest US units over a patent dispute, so those simply don't measure it.": {},
    "A couple of metrics depend on your model": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چەند پێوەرێک پشت بە مۆدێلەکەت دەبەستن"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چەند پێوەرێک پشت بە مۆدێلەکەت دەبەستن"}}}},
    "A few honest words, so nothing's a surprise.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چەند قسەیەکی ڕاستگۆیانە، تاکو هیچ شتێک سەرسوڕهێنەر نەبێت."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چەند قسەیەکی ڕاستگۆیانە، تاکو هیچ شتێک سەرسوڕهێنەر نەبێت."}}}},
    "A few more days and we can show your Fitness Age.": {},
    "A few more days and we can show your Vitality.": {},
    "A few more days of wear, plus the basics below, and we can show your Fitness Age.": {},
    "A few more nights of data and your readiness read will sharpen.": {},
    "A few signals are up": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چەند ئاماژەیەک بەرزبوونەوە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چەند ئاماژەیەک بەرزبوونەوە"}}}},
    "A gentle wrist buzz when you've been sitting too long, a nudge to get up and move. Inferred from the strap's motion on each history sync, so it lags real time by a sync or two.": {},
    "A logged caffeine is past your bedtime cutoff. It may still be on board and keep you up. Just a timing heads-up.": {},
    "A lower resting heart rate usually means a higher charge.": {},
    "A marker starts the selected phase and ends the previous one. This only timestamps the local capture file; it sends nothing to the strap.": {},
    "Clear the R22 flags on your strap?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئاڵاکانی R22 لەسەر بەندەکەت بسڕدرێنەوە؟"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئاڵاکانی R22 لەسەر بەندەکەت بسڕدرێنەوە؟"}}}},
    "Clear flags on strap": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "سڕینەوەی ئاڵاکان لەسەر بەند"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "سڕینەوەی ئاڵاکان لەسەر بەند"}}}},
    "Just stop sending": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تەنیا ناردن ڕابگرە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تەنیا ناردن ڕابگرە"}}}},
    "Turning this switch off only stops NOOP sending the unlock. The flags it already wrote stay on the strap until something clears them. NOOP can write the off value to all 16 now and read each one back so you can see what the strap actually stores. Needs the strap connected and bonded.": {},
    "WHOOP 5/MG straps hand a fresh app only live heart rate. The official app switches on the deeper streams (high-rate HR + motion + history) by writing a set of feature flags, a sequence two independent projects have documented. With this on, the button below sends that exact sequence to your strap. Unlike everything else here it does write to the strap — and it is reversible: “Turn deep data back off” writes the off value to the same flags and then reads every one of them back, so you see what the strap actually stores rather than just that it acked. Experimental: it may do nothing on your firmware. iPhone/Android only. A Mac can't write to a 5/MG.": {},
    "Strap accepted all %lld R22 flags": {},
    "Strap accepted %lld/%lld R22 flags…": {},
    "Clearing R22 flags and reading each one back…": {},
    "Turning deep data back off needs an iPhone or Android. A Mac can't form the encrypted bond a 5/MG requires.": {},
    "Needs the full encrypted bond: close the official WHOOP app and pair the strap to NOOP first (a live-HR-only link can't carry the write).": {},
    "Writes the off value to all 16 flags and reads each one back, so you see what the strap stores rather than just that it acked. The off value is inferred from the flag NOOP already turns off this way for Garmin broadcast — it has never been seen on an R22 flag, so NOOP tries one flag first and stops if the strap refuses it. Clearing the flags is not the same as watching the deep records stop: check that by syncing afterwards.": {},
    "A note on blood oxygen and your model": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تێبینییەک دەربارەی ئۆکسجینی خوێن و مۆدێلەکەت"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تێبینییەک دەربارەی ئۆکسجینی خوێن و مۆدێلەکەت"}}}},
    "A once-a-day nudge when your Effort reaches the low end of today's optimal strain range, worked out from your recovery.": {},
    "A period is likely between %@ and %@ (a window, not a fixed date).": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "A period is likely between %1$@ and %2$@, a window, not a fixed date."}}}},
    "A private notebook, not a medical service.": {},
    "A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain, read straight from your strap, kept only on this Mac.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain, read straight from your strap, kept only on this Mac."}}}},
    "A private window into your recovery, sleep and strain. Read straight from your strap, kept only on %@.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پەنجەرەیەکی تایبەت بۆ چاکبوونەوە، خەو و فشاری جەستەت. ڕاستەوخۆ لە بەندەکەتەوە دەخوێنرێتەوە و تەنیا لەسەر %@ دەمێنێتەوە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پەنجەرەیەکی تایبەت بۆ چاکبوونەوە، خەو و فشاری جەستەت. ڕاستەوخۆ لە بەندەکەتەوە دەخوێنرێتەوە و تەنیا لەسەر %@ دەمێنێتەوە."}}}},
    "A quick word before we connect": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "قسەیەکی کورت پێش پەیوەستبوون"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "قسەیەکی کورت پێش پەیوەستبوون"}}}},
    "A read-only Plews/Altini smallest-worthwhile-change reading of your nightly HRV: it shows whether your 7-night HRV baseline sits above, inside, or below your personal normal band. It changes nothing else - the Charge ring is identical whether this is on or off. This is rough / early testing, not yet validated against varying real data (n=1).": {},
    "A read-only export of the decoded sensor streams NOOP already stores. Works on any strap. Nothing is written to your device, and nothing is uploaded.": {},
    "A relaxation rhythm, not cardiac control. It never paces below a safe rate and you can stop anytime. If your heart rate doesn't settle, we'll say so plainly.": {},
    "A reminder to recharge before bed when the strap drops to 15%, and a heads-up when it reaches 100%, each at most once per charge cycle.": {},
    "A ring talks to one owner at a time.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەڵقە لە یەک کاتدا لەگەڵ یەک خاوەن قسە دەکات."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەڵقە لە یەک کاتدا لەگەڵ یەک خاوەن قسە دەکات."}}}},
    "A shareable one-page PDF of recovery, sleep, HRV, resting HR and strain over a range, saved on your %@.": {},
    "A signature ring distils HRV, resting heart rate and sleep into one calm read on whether to push or rest.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بازنەیەکی تایبەت گۆڕانی لێدانی دڵ، لێدانی دڵ لە پشوودا و خەو لە یەک خوێندنەوەی ئارامدا کورت دەکاتەوە: ئایا فشار بخەیتە سەر خۆت یان پشوو بدەیت."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بازنەیەکی تایبەت گۆڕانی لێدانی دڵ، لێدانی دڵ لە پشوودا و خەو لە یەک خوێندنەوەی ئارامدا کورت دەکاتەوە: ئایا فشار بخەیتە سەر خۆت یان پشوو بدەیت."}}}},
    "A simple goal that adjusts to your effort. General wellness guidance, not medical advice.": {},
    "A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device, your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device, your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app."}}}},
    "A standalone companion for your WHOOP. Everything stays on this device: your history, your live stream, your numbers. Nothing is uploaded. NOOP is an independent, experimental project, not the WHOOP app.": {},
    "A still, seated snapshot of your heart-rate variability": {},
    "A sync is already in progress.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوکاتکردنێک پێشتر بەردەوامە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوکاتکردنێک پێشتر بەردەوامە."}}}},
    "A transparent cardiorespiratory recipe that recovers deep and REM better than the default staging. Opt-in and experimental: it only changes how already-detected nights are split into stages (detection and scores are unchanged), and the default staging stays in place if you leave this off. Takes effect on the next nights staged.": {},
    "A transparent cardiorespiratory recipe that recovers deep and REM better than the older V1 staging, and is now the default. It only changes how already-detected nights are split into stages (detection and scores are unchanged); turn it off to fall back to V1. Takes effect on the next nights staged.": {},
    "A typical recent day": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕۆژێکی ئاسایی نوێ"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕۆژێکی ئاسایی نوێ"}}}},
    "A watch samples your heart-rate variability rather than streaming it all night, so your Charge score needs roughly seven nights to calibrate. Until then NOOP shows “needs more data”, never a guessed number.": {},
    "A weekly digest needs a few days of history. Wear your strap or import your WHOOP export in Data Sources.": {},
    "A wellness estimate from your habits, not a clinical biological age.": {},
    "ADVANCED": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پێشکەوتوو"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پێشکەوتوو"}}}},
