    "Advanced: use your own key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پێشکەوتوو: کلیلی خۆت بەکاربهێنە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پێشکەوتوو: کلیلی خۆت بەکاربهێنە"}}}},
    "Aerobic": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەیرۆبیک"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەیرۆبیک"}}}},
    "After a sync, NOOP looks over your recent heart rate for a sustained, raised stretch that looks like exercise and offers to save it. It only ever suggests. Nothing is saved until you tap Save, and you can dismiss any suggestion. Turning this off stops future suggestions but keeps your existing workout history. Deliberately conservative, so the odd workout may be missed. On %@ only.": {},
    "After high-intensity effort": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دوای هەوڵی توند"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دوای هەوڵی توند"}}}},
    "After tonight's sleep": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دوای خەوی ئەمشەو"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دوای خەوی ئەمشەو"}}}},
    "After your iPhone reboots, unlock it once. Until you do, iOS keeps NOOP's files locked (Data Protection), so new history can't be written or synced.": {},
