    "All of this is computed on your own device from data you already have. No heartbeat data leaves it.": {},
    "All stays on %@. Nothing is sent anywhere.": {},
    "Allow Apple Health access": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕێگەدان بە دەستگەیشتن بە Apple Health"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕێگەدان بە دەستگەیشتن بە Apple Health"}}}},
    "Allow access": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕێگەدان بە دەستگەیشتن"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕێگەدان بە دەستگەیشتن"}}}},
    "Already clean.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پێشتر پاکە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پێشتر پاکە."}}}},
    "Also share my patterns & Lab Book": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوبەشی بکە لەگەڵ شێوازەکانم و دەفتەری تاقیگە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوبەشی بکە لەگەڵ شێوازەکانم و دەفتەری تاقیگە"}}}},
    "Also share my patterns and Lab Book with the coach": {},
    "Always rely on your doctor, pharmacist, or a qualified professional to interpret results and make decisions. If a number worries you, talk to them, not to an app.": {},
    "Amount": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بڕ"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بڕ"}}}},
    "Amount in mg (optional)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بڕ بە مگم (ئارەزوومەندانە)"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بڕ بە مگم (ئارەزوومەندانە)"}}}},
    "Amount in millilitres": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بڕ بە میلی‌لیتر"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بڕ بە میلی‌لیتر"}}}},
    "An HRV reading needs the live R-R stream. Open the Live screen and connect your strap, then come back.": {},
    "An estimated VO2max from the Nes / HUNT Fitness Study model (resting heart rate, age and activity), read against population norms to express it as a fitness age.": {},
    "An experimental picture of your beat-to-beat heart timing. Not an ECG and not a diagnosis. You'll read and accept an experimental note before it shows anything.": {},
    "An experimental picture of your beat-to-beat timing": {},
    "An experimental picture of your beat-to-beat timing. Please read these first.": {},
    "Analyse my sleep": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "خەوەکەم شیکار بکە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "خەوەکەم شیکار بکە"}}}},
    "And make sure it's charged.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دڵنیابە کە شەحن کراوە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دڵنیابە کە شەحن کراوە."}}}},
    "Answers are about the night and day leading into this morning, the same attribution a WHOOP export uses, so logged and imported days line up.": {},
    "Any OpenAI-compatible server: Ollama, LM Studio, llama.cpp, or your own gateway. Stays on your network; nothing leaves %@.": {},
    "Key header": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "سەرپەڕەی کلیل"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "سەرپەڕەی کلیل"}}}},
    "Use Bearer for most local servers; use x-api-key for gateways that require the key in that header.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Use Bearer for most local servers; use x-api-key for gateways that require the key in that header."}}}},
    "Any amount helps. Thank you, genuinely.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەر بڕێک یارمەتیدەرە. سوپاس، بە دڵسۆزی."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەر بڕێک یارمەتیدەرە. سوپاس، بە دڵسۆزی."}}}},
    "Anything that needs Oura's cloud (web dashboard, Oura's coaching, shared circles).": {},
    "Anything you see here (including any side-by-side trend) is your own information shown back to you. It's an association, never a cause, and never a medical finding.": {},
    "App icon": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئایکۆنی ئەپ"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئایکۆنی ئەپ"}}}},
    "Appearance": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕووکار"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕووکار"}}}},
    "Apple": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Apple"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Apple"}}}},
    "Apple Health": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Apple Health"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Apple Health"}}}},
    "Apple Health (Live)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Apple Health (ڕاستەوخۆ)"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Apple Health (ڕاستەوخۆ)"}}}},
    "Apple Health isn't available on %@.": {},
    "Apple Health isn't available on this device, so there's nothing to connect here.": {},
    "Apple Health lives on the iPhone, not the Mac, so connecting your Apple Watch happens there. Open NOOP on your iPhone, head to Settings, and run this same Apple Watch setup. Your scores then show up across your devices.": {},
    "Apple Health sync failed: %@": {},
    "Apple Watch. Needs more data to score this yet.": {},
    "Apple's own sleep stages drive Rest directly. This is one of the watch's strengths.": {},
    "Apple's sleep stages are strong, and they drive your Rest score directly.": {},
    "Apple-logged": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تۆمارکراوی Apple"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تۆمارکراوی Apple"}}}},
    "Apr": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "نیسان"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "نیسان"}}}},
    "Armed on the strap with an experimental 5/MG command. Strap-driven wakes have been reported on 5.0 and MG, but are not guaranteed. Keep a backup alarm for anything you cannot miss.": {},
    "Armed on the strap itself, so it can buzz at your wake time even if your phone is asleep or NOOP is closed. Sends the exact alarm command the official app sends, confirmed buzzing on a real WHOOP 4.0 (community wire capture + on-device test, #535). Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can't miss.": {},
    "Armed on the strap itself, so it can buzz at your wake time even if your phone is asleep or NOOP is closed. We send the same alarm command the official app sends, but a strap-driven wake-up hasn't been confirmed on our side yet, so please keep a backup alarm for now.": {},
    "Arms the strap to buzz at your wake time, even if NOOP is closed. Sends the exact alarm command the official app sends, confirmed buzzing on a real WHOOP 4.0 (community wire capture + on-device test, #535). Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can't miss.": {},
    "Arms the strap to buzz at your wake time, even if NOOP is closed. Still experimental on WHOOP 4.0, so keep a backup alarm until you've confirmed it wakes you.": {},
    "Arrange Today": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕێکخستنی ئەمڕۆ"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕێکخستنی ئەمڕۆ"}}}},
    "Ask Coach about your data…": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لە ڕاهێنەر بپرسە دەربارەی داتاکانت…"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لە ڕاهێنەر بپرسە دەربارەی داتاکانت…"}}}},
    "Ask about your charge, effort, rest and workouts, grounded in your own numbers.": {},
    "Ask about your recovery, strain, sleep and workouts, grounded in your own numbers.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ask about your recovery, strain, sleep and workouts, grounded in your own numbers."}}}},
    "Ask your first question": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "یەکەم پرسیارەکەت بکە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "یەکەم پرسیارەکەت بکە"}}}},
    "Asks the strap for config VALUES: GET_DEVICE_CONFIG_VALUE (0x79) and GET_FF_VALUE (0x80), one key per round-trip. Both commands may simply not exist in this firmware — finding that out is the point. Read-only — no value is written, and the SET commands are never sent from this probe. The result is shown here and written to the strap log.": {},
    "Asks the strap to list the feature-flag NAMES its own firmware knows: START_FF_KEY_EXCHANGE (0x75) then SEND_NEXT_FF (0x76) until the strap says it's done. Read-only — no flag value is written, and the SET commands are never sent from this probe. The list is shown here and written to the strap log.": {},
