    "Event": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕووداو"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ڕووداو"}}}},
    "Every beat, every night, every day, woven into one quiet picture of you. Welcome to NOOP.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو لێدانێک، هەموو شەوێک، هەموو ڕۆژێک، لە یەک وێنەی ئارامی تۆدا ڕێکخراون. بەخێربێیت بۆ NOOP."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو لێدانێک، هەموو شەوێک، هەموو ڕۆژێک، لە یەک وێنەی ئارامی تۆدا ڕێکخراون. بەخێربێیت بۆ NOOP."}}}},
    "Every day": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو ڕۆژێک"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو ڕۆژێک"}}}},
    "Every metric is an unvalidated approximation. Don't use NOOP to diagnose, treat, or make any health decision. Always consult a qualified professional.": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو پێوەرێک خەمڵاندنێکی پشتڕاستنەکراوە. NOOP بۆ دەستنیشانکردن، چارەسەر یان هیچ بڕیارێکی تەندروستی بەکارمەهێنە. هەمیشە ڕاوێژ بە پسپۆڕێکی شارەزا بکە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو پێوەرێک خەمڵاندنێکی پشتڕاستنەکراوە. NOOP بۆ دەستنیشانکردن، چارەسەر یان هیچ بڕیارێکی تەندروستی بەکارمەهێنە. هەمیشە ڕاوێژ بە پسپۆڕێکی شارەزا بکە."}}}},
    "Every release, mirrored. A fallback if GitHub is ever down.": {},
    "Every score carries a small honesty label. Calibrating means NOOP is still learning your baseline, or doesn't have enough data yet. Building means there's enough to show, but it's thin. Solid means full inputs are present. When NOOP can't compute a score honestly, it shows nothing rather than a fake number.": {},
    "Every second of your day, zoomable.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو چرکەیەکی ڕۆژەکەت، بە شێوەی گەورەکراو."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو چرکەیەکی ڕۆژەکەت، بە شێوەی گەورەکراو."}}}},
    "Every session, threaded together.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو دانیشتنێک، بە یەکەوە بەستراو."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو دانیشتنێک، بە یەکەوە بەستراو."}}}},
    "Every signal, one tap deep.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو ئاماژەیەک، بە یەک دەستلێدان."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو ئاماژەیەک، بە یەک دەستلێدان."}}}},
    "Everyone has a breathing pace (usually between 4.5 and 7 breaths a minute) where the heart's rhythm swings the most with each breath. We pace you through a few candidate paces, measure how your HRV responds, and lock the one that resonates best for you.": {},
    "Everything else, one tap away": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو شتێکی تر، بە یەک دەستلێدان"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو شتێکی تر، بە یەک دەستلێدان"}}}},
    "Everything here is a pattern in your own logged days: an association with an effect size and confidence, never a cause or a diagnosis. Population patterns are shown as “typical” and are always overridden by your own data once you have enough of it. Approximations, not WHOOP’s scores; not a medical device.": {},
    "Everything lives on %@. No account, no sync, no cloud. Your thread is yours alone.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو شتێک لەسەر %@ دەمێنێتەوە. بێ هەژمار، بێ هاوکاتکردن، بێ کڵاود. هێڵەکەت تەنیا هی خۆتە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو شتێک لەسەر %@ دەمێنێتەوە. بێ هەژمار، بێ هاوکاتکردن، بێ کڵاود. هێڵەکەت تەنیا هی خۆتە."}}}},
    "Everything stays on %@. Bring your history in once, then it's yours.": {},
    "Everything stays on this Mac. Bring your history in once, then it's yours.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Everything stays on this Mac. Bring your history in once, then it's yours."}}}},
    "Everything stays on your device": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو شتێک لەسەر ئامێرەکەت دەمێنێتەوە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەموو شتێک لەسەر ئامێرەکەت دەمێنێتەوە"}}}},
