    "Experimental sleep staging (V2)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "قۆناغبەندیی تاقیکارانەی خەو (V2)"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "قۆناغبەندیی تاقیکارانەی خەو (V2)"}}}},
    "Experimental wellness visualization: not a diagnosis, not an ECG, and not a medical device. It cannot detect any heart condition. Beat-to-beat variation has many ordinary, benign causes. If you feel unwell or are worried, contact a qualified professional; in an emergency, your local emergency service. Everything is computed on your device.": {},
    "Experimental · Sleep staging": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکاری · قۆناغبەندیی خەو"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکاری · قۆناغبەندیی خەو"}}}},
    "Experimental · WHOOP 5 / MG": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکاری · WHOOP 5 / MG"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکاری · WHOOP 5 / MG"}}}},
    "Experimental, and not a medical device": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکارییە و ئامێری پزیشکی نییە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکارییە و ئامێری پزیشکی نییە"}}}},
    "Experimental, best-effort support. We're still testing these, so they might not connect on every device. They never make up data, and they'll tell you honestly when live isn't possible.": {},
    "Experimental: at your own risk": {"extractionState": "manual", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکارانە: بە ئەستۆی خۆت"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تاقیکارانە: بە ئەستۆی خۆت"}}}},
    "Experimental: if your band needs pairing, we'll tell you honestly rather than show a fake reading.": {},
    "Experimental: live heart rate where the band exposes it. Some bands need a pairing we can't do yet. NOOP will say so honestly and never show a made-up number. No sleep, recovery, skin temp, SpO₂ or steps.": {},
    "Experimental: this is best-effort. If live doesn't work, you can export from Zepp and import the file.": {},
