    "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in, no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "I keep this project anonymous, so crypto is the only way to chip in, no Patreon, no PayPal, no name attached. Quick, global, and private for both of us."}}}},
