    "Live heart rate already works on a WHOOP 5/MG strap. These probes go further and try to coax more out of it. They are guesses, off by default, and only ever touch a 5/MG strap, WHOOP 4.0 is never affected.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Live heart rate already works on a WHOOP 5/MG strap. These probes go further and try to coax more out of it. They are guesses, off by default, and only ever touch a 5/MG strap, WHOOP 4.0 is never affected."}}}},
    "Live heart rate already works on a WHOOP 5/MG strap. These probes go further and try to coax more out of it. They are guesses, off by default, and only ever touch a 5/MG strap. WHOOP 4.0 is never affected.": {},
    "Live heart rate and energy, recorded on your wrist. Stays on device.": {},
    "Live heart rate appears here once a strap is connected.": {},
    "Live heart rate is flowing; full strap controls need an encrypted bond.": {},
    "Live heart rate is instant. Recovery, strain and sleep sharpen as NOOP learns your baseline over your first nights of wear. Want your history now? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute.": {},
    "Live heart rate on bands that don't need pairing. Help us test.": {},
