    "Live heart rate, and HRV when the ring can measure it.": {},
    "Live machine data over Bluetooth FTMS. No sleep, recovery, skin temp or SpO₂. Effort needs the machine's heart rate; without it the session logs the machine metrics only.": {},
    "Live now. Your scores are building.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئێستا ڕاستەوخۆیە. نمرەکانت بنیات دەنرێن."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئێستا ڕاستەوخۆیە. نمرەکانت بنیات دەنرێن."}}}},
