    "Move all your NOOP data to another machine. Export saves everything (history, sleeps, workouts, settings) to a single file you can copy across; import replaces %@'s data with a backup.": {},
    "Move all your NOOP data to another machine. Export saves everything, history, sleeps, workouts, settings, to a single file you can copy across; import replaces this Mac's data with a backup.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Move all your NOOP data to another machine. Export saves everything, history, sleeps, workouts, settings, to a single file you can copy across; import replaces this Mac's data with a backup."}}}},
