    "On %@": {},
    "On a 5/MG connection NOOP will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "On a 5/MG connection NOOP will send a puffin realtime-stream request after the handshake, and log what comes back. If you have a 5/MG strap, turning this on and sharing your strap log helps map the protocol. No effect on WHOOP 4.0."}}}},
    "On a beta version of iOS, things can break that work on the release build.": {},
    "On iPhone this is a sideloaded build. Re-sign it about every 7 days on a free Apple ID (longer on a paid account). After your phone reboots, unlock it once so NOOP can read and sync its data.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەم وەشانە لە دەرەوەی App Store دامەزراوە. نزیکەی هەر ٧ ڕۆژ جارێک بە Apple IDی بەخۆڕایی دووبارە واژۆی بکە (لەگەڵ هەژماری پارەدار ماوەکەی درێژترە). دوای دەستپێکردنەوەی تەلەفۆنەکەت، یەکجار قفڵی بکەرەوە تاکو NOOP بتوانێت داتاکانی بخوێنێتەوە و هاوکاتیان بکات."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ئەم وەشانە لە دەرەوەی App Store دامەزراوە. نزیکەی هەر ٧ ڕۆژ جارێک بە Apple IDی بەخۆڕایی دووبارە واژۆی بکە (لەگەڵ هەژماری پارەدار ماوەکەی درێژترە). دوای دەستپێکردنەوەی تەلەفۆنەکەت، یەکجار قفڵی بکەرەوە تاکو NOOP بتوانێت داتاکانی بخوێنێتەوە و هاوکاتیان بکات."}}}},
    "On iPhone this is best-effort (iOS decides when background tasks run). Everything stays on %@.": {},
    "On target": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر ئامانج"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر ئامانج"}}}},
    "On the days your phone also counted steps, NOOP learns how much your motion maps to steps, then applies that to the strap-only days. The more matching days it has, the more it trusts the estimate.": {},
    "On wrist": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر مەچەک"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر مەچەک"}}}},
    "On, your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "On, your recovery, sleep, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching."}}}},
    "On-device": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر ئامێر"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "لەسەر ئامێر"}}}},
    "On-device estimate (approximate), not a diagnosis.": {},
    "On-device footprint": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "شوێنی داگیرکراو لەسەر ئامێر"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "شوێنی داگیرکراو لەسەر ئامێر"}}}},
    "On: a short summary of your strongest patterns and logged health numbers is added. Summaries only, never raw readings.": {},
    "On: your charge, rest, HRV and workouts are shared with the provider for tailored coaching.": {},
    "Once NOOP has 14 nights of history, in-range compares each vital to your own baseline (approximate, not medical advice); until then, typical adult ranges apply.": {},
    "Once this week has a day or two of data, your week-in-review appears here.": {},
    "One of your signals is flagging. You can train, but keep it controlled and bank the recovery.": {},
    "One reading so far: %@ %@. Log a few more to see a trend.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "One reading so far: %1$@ %2$@. Log a few more to see a trend."}}}},
    "Only buzz when worn": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تەنیا کاتێک لەبەرە بلەرزێ"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تەنیا کاتێک لەبەرە بلەرزێ"}}}},
    "Only during active hours": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تەنیا لە کاتی چالاکیدا"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "تەنیا لە کاتی چالاکیدا"}}}},
