    "This sideloaded build expires in 1 day. Re-sign to keep it running.": {},
    "This split is the ring's raw on-device classification read over Bluetooth, not the adjusted stages the Oura app shows. Expect more Awake and less Deep/REM here than in the Oura app for the same night.": {},
    "This stands on community reverse-engineering. Huge thanks:": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This stands on community reverse-engineering. Huge thanks:"}}}},
