    "Unvalidated instrumentation, not a medical measurement and not a diagnosis.": {"comment": "MEDICAL SAFETY COPY — needs a native speaker, not a machine translation. Deliberately left untranslated: a disclaimer that drifts in meaning is worse than one shown in English. Until a human translates it, the absent localizations make the runtime fall back to this English source text, which is correct and complete. Keep every element when translating: not a medical device, not a diagnosis, and the instruction to see a doctor.", "shouldTranslate": false},
