    "WHAT TO EXPECT": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چاوەڕێی چی بکەیت"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "چاوەڕێی چی بکەیت"}}}},
    "WHAT'S NEW": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "نوێییەکان"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "نوێییەکان"}}}},
    "WHERE IT'S LIGHTER THAN A STRAP": {},
    "WHOOP 4.0 is tested and works end to end. WHOOP 5.0/MG is newer: live heart rate works today, but deeper metrics (recovery, strain, sleep) for 5/MG are still being figured out. NOOP always tells you what's live versus still building.": {},
    "WHOOP 4.0 is the supported path": {},
    "WHOOP 4.0 protocol": {},
    "WHOOP 4.0 reboot probe": {},
    "WHOOP 4.0 · motion → steps": {},
    "WHOOP 5 / MG": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "WHOOP 5 / MG"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "WHOOP 5 / MG"}}}},
    "WHOOP 5.0 / MG bonds to one device at a time. Unpair it from the official WHOOP app first.": {},
    "WHOOP 5.0 / MG support is newer and still experimental in NOOP.": {},
    "WHOOP 5.0 protocol": {},
    "WHOOP 5.0/MG pairs with one app at a time. If a scan finds nothing, unpair it in the official WHOOP app and fully close that app, then Scan again.": {},
    "WHOOP 5.0/MG pairs with one app at a time. If nothing's found, unpair it in the official WHOOP app and fully close that app, then Scan.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "WHOOP 5.0/MG لە یەک کاتدا تەنیا لەگەڵ یەک ئەپ جووت دەبێت. ئەگەر هیچ نەدۆزرایەوە، لە ئەپی فەرمیی WHOOP جووتبوونەکەی لابە و ئەو ئەپە بە تەواوی دابخە، پاشان «گەڕان» بکە."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "WHOOP 5.0/MG لە یەک کاتدا تەنیا لەگەڵ یەک ئەپ جووت دەبێت. ئەگەر هیچ نەدۆزرایەوە، لە ئەپی فەرمیی WHOOP جووتبوونەکەی لابە و ئەو ئەپە بە تەواوی دابخە، پاشان «گەڕان» بکە."}}}},
    "WHOOP 5/MG straps hand a fresh app only live heart rate. The official app switches on the deeper streams (high-rate HR + motion + history) by writing a set of feature flags, a sequence two independent projects have documented. With this on, the button below sends that exact sequence to your strap. Unlike everything else here it does write to the strap, but it's reversible (it only changes which data the strap chooses to emit) and is the same thing the official app does. Experimental: it may do nothing on your firmware. iPhone/Android only. A Mac can't write to a 5/MG.": {},
    "WHOOP Export": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەناردەی WHOOP"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هەناردەی WHOOP"}}}},
    "WHOOP MG ECG capture (experimental)": {},
    "WHOOP Strap (Live BLE)": {},
    "WHOOP import": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوردەی WHOOP"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "هاوردەی WHOOP"}}}},
    "WHOOP is NOOP's primary, fully-supported band. Other heart-rate straps are an early, in-development addition: they stream live heart rate and HRV, but not WHOOP's deeper sleep and recovery data.": {},
    "WHOOP is NOOP's primary, fully-supported band. Other heart-rate straps stream live heart rate and HRV, but not WHOOP's deeper sleep and recovery data.": {},
    "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like NOOP can find, so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "WHOOP straps don't appear in macOS System Settings → Bluetooth. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like NOOP can find, so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try."}}}},
    "WHOOP straps don't appear in your %@'s Bluetooth settings. They advertise on a custom profile that only apps like NOOP can find, so there's nothing to pair there, and you shouldn't try.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بەندەکانی WHOOP لە ڕێکخستنەکانی بلووتووسی %@ەکەتدا دەرناکەون. ئەوان بە پرۆفایلێکی تایبەت خۆیان ڕادەگەیەنن کە تەنیا ئەپی وەک NOOP دەیدۆزنەوە، بۆیە لەوێ شتێک نییە جووتی بکەیت و نابێت هەوڵی بدەیت."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بەندەکانی WHOOP لە ڕێکخستنەکانی بلووتووسی %@ەکەتدا دەرناکەون. ئەوان بە پرۆفایلێکی تایبەت خۆیان ڕادەگەیەنن کە تەنیا ئەپی وەک NOOP دەیدۆزنەوە، بۆیە لەوێ شتێک نییە جووتی بکەیت و نابێت هەوڵی بدەیت."}}}},
