    "Watch": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "کاتژمێر"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "کاتژمێر"}}}},
    "Watch for early-illness signs": {},
    "Watch your heart, live": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دڵت ڕاستەوخۆ ببینە"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "دڵت ڕاستەوخۆ ببینە"}}}},
    "Watches your resting HR, HRV, skin temperature and respiration against your own 28-day baseline. On-device and approximate: informational only, not a diagnosis.": {},
    "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV to your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up, classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift is mapped onto a 0-3 scale: 0 is calm, 1.5 sits at your baseline, 3 is highly activated.": {},
    "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV to your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up, classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift is mapped onto a 0–3 scale: 0 is calm, 1.5 sits at your baseline, 3 is highly activated.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "We compare today's resting heart rate and HRV to your own 30-day baseline. A higher-than-usual resting HR and a lower-than-usual HRV both push the score up, classic signs the body is activated. The combined shift is mapped onto a 0–3 scale: 0 is calm, 1.5 sits at your baseline, 3 is highly activated."}}}},
    "We could not take over this ring.": {},
    "We're not seeing any motion from your strap yet. Steps are estimated from your WHOOP's banked motion history, so your strap needs to sync that history before NOOP has anything to count.": {},
    "Wear & presence": {},
    "Wear it snug on your wrist or bicep, sensor against skin.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بە تەنگی لەسەر مەچەک یان قۆڵت لەبەری بکە، هەستەوەرەکە بە پێستەوە بنووسێت."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "بە تەنگی لەسەر مەچەک یان قۆڵت لەبەری بکە، هەستەوەرەکە بە پێستەوە بنووسێت."}}}},
