    "Yesterday’s Synthesis": {},
    "You can change what you share any time in Settings › Health › Data Access & Devices.": {},
    "You can still bring your data in by importing a Health export from Data Sources. A build from the App Store, or one signed with a paid Apple Developer account, connects directly.": {},
    "You held the band. Right where today wanted you.": {},
    "You removed your active strap. Choose which paired band provides your live data, or leave none active and pair one later.": {},
    "You said: %@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "You said: %@"}}}},
    "You'll be reminded around %@.": {},
    "You'll likely wake around %lld ± %lld Charge if you sleep about %@ tonight.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "You'll likely wake around %1$lld ± %2$lld Charge if you sleep about %3$@ tonight."}}}},
    "You're all caught up.": {},
    "You're carrying about %@ of surplus over %@. You've slept past your need on balance. Nicely ahead.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "You're carrying about %1$@ of surplus over %2$@. You've slept past your need on balance. Nicely ahead."}}}},
    "You're connected.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پەیوەست بوویت."}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پەیوەست بوویت."}}}},
    "You're connected. NOOP is reading your Apple Watch data now. Your Charge score will spend its first week or so calibrating, then settle in.": {},
    "You're in a good spot for training.": {},
    "You're in balance with your baseline, so moderate strain is well-judged": {},
    "You're on the latest (%@).": {},
    "You're primed. A hard session should land well today.": {},
    "You're roughly on top of your sleep across %@. Slept minutes balance out against your need.": {},
    "You're sitting around your typical autonomic baseline: moderate stress, a normal, balanced day.": {},
    "You've banked about %@ of sleep debt over %@. Surplus nights count back against it. An earlier night or two would clear it.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "You've banked about %1$@ of sleep debt over %2$@. Surplus nights count back against it. An earlier night or two would clear it."}}}},
    "You've been seated for about %lld min. Time to move.": {},
    "You've hit today's optimal strain target of %lld. Nice work — your recovery earned it.": {},
    "Your Apple Watch as a device": {},
    "Your Charge (recovery) on the watch face, with Effort and Rest in the rectangular card.": {},
    "Your Charge score learns a personal baseline from your heart-rate variability, resting heart rate and more over time. If a bad first week set it off, you can re-learn it from tonight. Your history stays.": {},
    "Your Data, Fused": {},
    "Your GPS route for this session, recorded and stored on your device. Nothing leaves your phone.": {},
    "Your HRV dipped while you were still. Want a minute to breathe?": {},
    "Your Monday-to-Sunday, read in one glance.": {},
    "WHOOP 5/MG strap alarms require Protocol probes (Test Centre → 5/MG protocol diagnostics). Your wake time is saved, but the strap is not armed yet. Keep a backup alarm.": {},
    "Your WHOOP is at 100%.": {},
    "Your WHOOP only talks to one phone at a time.": {},
    "Your autonomic markers are skewed toward stress today. Treat it as a recovery-focused day.": {},
    "Your bands report different numbers. Here's every source, and the one NOOP is using.": {},
    "Your bloods, BP and body numbers. Kept private, on %@.": {},
    "Your cardiovascular load. NOOP turns every second of heart rate into a training-impulse using heart-rate-reserve zones (Karvonen), weights time in harder zones more heavily (Edwards / Banister), and places it on a logarithmic 0–100 scale, so easy days sit low and an all-out day approaches 100, which stays genuinely rare. A long walk with little cardio still counts, through a steps / active-energy floor.": {},
    "Your cards": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "کارتەکانت"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "کارتەکانت"}}}},
    "Your current strap": {},
    "Your curve fills in as the strap offloads its history.": {},
    "Your data has been restored. Quit and reopen NOOP for it to take effect.": {},
    "Your fluid intake today, on %@ only.": {},
    "Your last %lld hours have stayed in the high band. A few minutes of paced breathing can help downshift your nervous system.": {},
    "Your last %lld readings: %@ %@, holding steady.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "Your last %1$lld readings: %2$@ %3$@, holding steady."}}}},
    "Your last %lld readings: %@ %@, trending down.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "Your last %1$lld readings: %2$@ %3$@, trending down."}}}},
    "Your last %lld readings: %@ %@, trending up.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "new", "value": "Your last %1$lld readings: %2$@ %3$@, trending up."}}}},
    "Your live heart rate is working from the strap, and charge, effort and rest build from it over your next few nights of wear, sharpening as it learns your baseline. Want your full history instantly? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute.": {},
    "Your live heart rate is working from the strap, and recovery, strain and sleep build from it over your next few nights of wear, sharpening as it learns your baseline. Want your full history instantly? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute.": {"extractionState": "stale", "localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Your live heart rate is working from the strap, and recovery, strain and sleep build from it over your next few nights of wear, sharpening as it learns your baseline. Want your full history instantly? Import your WHOOP export in Data Sources and it backfills in about a minute."}}}},
