    "Legacy R22 feature-flag experiment. The strap accepts these writes, but NOOP has not observed them enabling a separate live stream. This is not required for normal WHOOP 5/MG support or for the Raw Data Collector. It writes persistent strap settings and may do nothing on your firmware.": {"shouldTranslate": false},
