    "NOOP (in Files)": {},
    "Live heart rate is streaming, but your strap is not fully paired. The encrypted pairing is what carries motion, skin temperature, SpO₂ and respiratory rate — without it, sleep is staged from heart rate alone. Buzz, alarms and history sync need it too.": {},
    "Clear conversation": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Clear conversation"}}}},
    "Clear the saved conversation": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Clear the saved conversation"}}}},
    "Clear conversation?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Clear conversation?"}}}},
    "This deletes the saved conversation from this device. Coach history is your own notes, not medical advice.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This deletes the saved conversation from this device. Coach history is your own notes, not medical advice."}}}},
    "Morning brief": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پوختەی بەیانی"}}, "ckb": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "پوختەی بەیانی"}}}},
    "A local notification with today's readiness + training plan, generated on-device each morning.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "A local notification with today's readiness + training plan, generated on-device each morning."}}}},
    "Off: nothing is generated or sent on a schedule.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Off: nothing is generated or sent on a schedule."}}}},
    "Morning brief time": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Morning brief time"}}}},
    "At %@, NOOP will use your key to generate today's brief. Best-effort: %@ decides exactly when a backgrounded app wakes.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "At %@, NOOP will use your key to generate today's brief. Best-effort: %@ decides exactly when a backgrounded app wakes."}}}},
    "Send chart image to Gemini": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Send chart image to Gemini"}}}},
    "On: a chart snapshot of your trends is sent with each question. Gemini can analyze the visual.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "On: a chart snapshot of your trends is sent with each question. Gemini can analyze the visual."}}}},
    "Off: only text is sent. Enable to let Gemini see your charts.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Off: only text is sent. Enable to let Gemini see your charts."}}}},
