    "Re-derives the absolute °C for nights the 21-night rescore window never reaches, using the same funnel as the scoring pass. Fill-only: it never overwrites a measured value. Watch the strap log for the result.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Re-derives the absolute °C for nights the 21-night rescore window never reaches, using the same funnel as the scoring pass. Fill-only: it never overwrites a measured value. Watch the strap log for the result."}}}},
